  "version": 1,
  "note": "Single source of truth for the meta layer. Each task costs stars, lights up one scene item and unmutes one music stem of the district track. Stars: sum(cost) per district. Each district is also a jukebox genre: `genre` is the tab name and `songs` are the extra songs of that genre (single full mixes in the key of the district; the first song of a genre is the layered district theme itself). Art generator writes item positions to content/district_layouts.json; audio generator (tools/audio) writes assets/music/<district>/<stem>.ogg and assets/music/songs/<song>.ogg.",
